  data: {
    LLM: "Bidding (10, 15, 20, 25, or 60) starts left of dealer; dealer may 'take' by equalling the bid. Highest bidder picks up the five-card kitty, discards five, and names trump (no robbing). Player to dealer's left leads; same card ranking as Twenty-Five (5 of trump highest, then J, then A of hearts).",
    Player: "Bidding (10, 15, 20, 25, or 60) starts left of dealer; dealer may 'take' by equalling the bid. Highest bidder picks up the five-card kitty, discards five, and names trump (no robbing). Player to dealer's left leads; same card ranking as Twenty-Five (5 of trump highest, then J, then A of hearts).",
    objective: 'Be the first player (or team) to reach 110 points. Each trick is worth 5 points; the holder of the highest trump in play gets an extra 5 points.',
