      'Scoring example: Bidder scores trick points if total ≥ bid, else loses the bid amount. Bid of 60 = win all tricks: score 60 or lose 60. Others score for their tricks. First to 110 wins; if two reach it in the same deal, order of tricks determines winner. Be the first player (or team) to reach 110 points. Each trick is worth 5 points; the holder of the highest trump in play gets an extra 5 points..',
